---
import Aside from './Aside.astro'
import FrontendMD from '../components/frontend.md'
import BackendMD from '../components/backend.md'
---
<Aside className={['relative', 'h-full', 'overflow-hidden']} >
    <div class="origin-bottom-right z-[-1] left-[80px] top-[-40px] absolute rotate-[-90deg] justify-start gradient-transparent text-[150px] font-normal qwigley">GolotaDanil</div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <h1 class="justify-start gradient-red text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-normal">GD portfolio</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="text-sm sm:text-lg">
        Hi, welcome to my page. I'm Danil, I'm glad to see you. I'm a web frontend developer. Basically, I work with Vue/Nuxt, but I love working with Elysia.
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
        <div class="text-2xl">
            💻 Frontend Stack
        </div>

        <div class="md-badges">
            <FrontendMD />
        </div>

        <div class="text-2xl">
            🌐 Backend & Environment Stack
        </div>

        <div class="md-badges">
            <BackendMD />
        </div>
    </div>

    <main class="text-sm sm:text-lg">
        I'd like to work with internal services, like an intranet. Not so far away, I already worked with a Squid proxy real-time analyzer. By the way, it's a project for my dad, and it's really more interesting than working with online shops or simple landing pages.
    </main>
</Aside>